    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our cat Ivy has left the house and run off, and it's up to our heroes to find him! Play as one of four unique and delightful characters as you make your way through a hand-drawn world of crayon and pen. Collect items, solve puzzles, run and jump, and battle bosses on your own or with local and online friends. Four heroes are better than one, after all!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our cat Ivy has left the house and run off, and it's up to our heroes to find him! Play as one of four unique and delightful characters as you make your way through a hand-drawn world of crayon and pen. Collect items, solve puzzles, run and jump, and battle bosses on your own or with local and online friends. Four heroes are better than one, after all!</p>",
    "short_description": "Finding Ivy is a cute casual 2D platformer where 1-4 players make their way through a kid-drawn world to win back their runaway cat. Run, jump, climb, and discover items and friends that help you along the way!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
